{"candidateAnswer":"Consider changing his work arrangement so he can live somewhere more spacious near nature","evidence":"[D12:3 | 10:05 am on 11 July, 2023] Andrew: Haha yeah! Toby's definitely bringing a lot of joy. Since we last talked, work has been piling up and I've been stuck inside. I miss the peace and feeling of freedom that comes with going for a hike.\n[D18:1 | 7:49 pm on 6 September, 2023] Andrew: Hey Audrey, how's it going? Since we last talked, a few new things have come up in my life. Work's been tough and stressful, so my outdoor activities have taken a backseat. Finding balance has been challenging.\n[D21:5 | 4:18 pm on 4 October, 2023] Andrew: Haven't been to the beach in a while. Miss being outdoors. It's hard to find open spaces in the city. Used to hike a lot, but it's more challenging now with my work life balance.","itemId":"urn:uuid:cf300468-1642-5fc1-b265-787d3d38499a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4824a9cec7f611f51086ec67f66e7130a3f5b4c876017733775c3ce361d49b07","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What can Andrew potentially do to improve his stress and accomodate his living situation with his dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Change to a hybrid or remote job so he can move away from the city to the suburbs to have a larger living space and be closer to nature.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4824a9cec7f611f51086ec67f66e7130a3f5b4c876017733775c3ce361d49b07"}}]}